    # Navigation template strings
    old "I'm heading to %s. See you later."
    new "Voy a %s. Nos vemos luego."

    old "I was thinking of going to %s. Want to come with me?"
    new "Estaba pensando en ir a %s. Quieres venir conmigo?"

    old "Sure, let's go."
    new "Claro, vamos."

    # game/scripts/General/navigation.rpy:875
    old "Not now."
    new "Ahora no."

    # game/scripts/General/navigation.rpy:914
    old "Sure, come along."
    new "Claro, ven conmigo."

    # game/scripts/General/navigation.rpy:919
    old "No, you stay. I'll be back."
    new "No, quedate. Ya vuelvo."

    old "I don't want to see you right now. Get out."
    new "No quiero verte ahora. Vete."

    old "Sorry, I have something else to do."
    new "Perdon, tengo otra cosa que hacer."

    old "I have something else to do."
    new "Tengo otra cosa que hacer."

    old "All right, I'll go on my own."
    new "Esta bien, voy solo."

    old "This place is closing... let's head back."
    new "Este lugar esta cerrando... volvamos."

    old "You're leaving already? Want me to come with you?"
    new "Ya te vas? Quieres que vaya contigo?"

    old "Yay! Let's go."
    new "Genial! Vamos."

    old "Okay... don't take too long."
    new "Ok... no tardes mucho."

    old "Time is moving, but I would rather stay with you."
    new "El tiempo pasa, pero prefiero quedarme contigo."

    old "I think I will stay here a bit longer."
    new "Creo que me voy a quedar aqui un rato mas."

    # Nerd class attendance
    old "Hey, class is about to start. Want to come with me?"
    new "Oye, la clase esta por empezar. Quieres venir conmigo?"

    old "We should head to class. Come on, it'll be fun... well, educational at least."
    new "Deberiamos ir a clase. Vamos, sera divertido... bueno, educativo al menos."

    old "I don't want to be late. Come to class with me?"
    new "No quiero llegar tarde. Vienes a clase conmigo?"

    old "I'll pass."
    new "Paso."

    old "Stay with me instead."
    new "Quédate conmigo."

    old "Suit yourself. I'm not missing class though."
    new "Tu te lo pierdes. Pero yo no voy a faltar a clase."

    old "Your loss. I'll save you a seat in case you change your mind."
    new "Te lo pierdes. Te guardo un asiento por si cambias de opinion."

    old "Fine, but don't blame me if you miss something important."
    new "Esta bien, pero no me culpes si te pierdes algo importante."

    old "Fine... but we're studying together later, deal?"
    new "Bueno... pero vamos a estudiar juntos despues, trato?"

    old "Okay, but only this once. And you're helping me catch up on notes later."
    new "Ok, pero solo esta vez. Y me vas a ayudar a ponerme al dia con los apuntes despues."

    old "You're a bad influence, you know that? ...Fine, I'll stay."
    new "Eres una mala influencia, lo sabias? ...Bueno, me quedo."

    old "Sorry, I really can't skip. Maybe we can hang out after class?"
    new "Perdon, de verdad no puedo faltar. Podemos salir despues de clase?"

    old "I appreciate the offer, but class is important. We can study together later if you want."
    new "Agradezco la oferta, pero la clase es importante. Podemos estudiar juntos despues si quieres."

    old "No, I really should go. Come find me after, okay?"
    new "No, de verdad tengo que ir. Buscame despues, si?"

    # ── Nerd skip: exam week (Obed >= 500) ──

    old "The exam is THIS WEEK! We need to study! I'm serious! ...Fine, but we're studying ALL night."
    new "El examen es ESTA SEMANA! Necesitamos estudiar! Lo digo en serio! ...Bueno, pero vamos a estudiar TODA la noche."

    old "Are you crazy?! The exam is in a few days! ...Ugh, okay, but only because you asked nicely."
    new "Estas loco?! El examen es en unos dias! ...Ugh, bueno, pero solo porque lo pediste bien."

    old "You're going to be the reason I fail... The exam is so close! ...Okay, but we study together later. No excuses."
    new "Tu vas a ser la razon por la que repruebo... El examen esta tan cerca! ...Bueno, pero estudiamos juntos despues. Sin excusas."

    # ── Nerd skip: repeat (2-3 times) ──

    old "Again? You already asked me to skip... you're such a troublemaker."
    new "Otra vez? Ya me pediste que faltara... eres un busca problemas."

    old "You know, I'm starting to notice a pattern here... Fine, but this is the last time!"
    new "Sabes, estoy empezando a notar un patron aqui... Bueno, pero esta es la ultima vez!"

    old "Okay, okay. But this is the LAST time! We need to study!"
    new "Bueno, bueno. Pero esta es la ULTIMA vez! Necesitamos estudiar!"

    # ── Nerd skip: frequent (4+) ──

    old "At this point, I don't even know why I bother going to class..."
    new "A estas alturas, ni se por que me molesto en ir a clase..."

    old "You've turned me into a delinquent, you know that? ...Let's go."
    new "Me convertiste en una delincuente, lo sabias? ...Vamos."

    old "My attendance is already ruined... what's one more class?"
    new "Mi asistencia ya esta arruinada... que es una clase mas?"

    # ── Nerd refuse: exam week (Obed < 500) ──

    old "Are you kidding?! The exam is THIS WEEK! I'm going to class and so should you!"
    new "Estas bromeando?! El examen es ESTA SEMANA! Voy a clase y tu tambien deberias!"

    old "No way! Not with the exam so close. I'll see you after, but I NEED to study!"
    new "De ninguna manera! No con el examen tan cerca. Te veo despues, pero NECESITO estudiar!"

    old "Absolutely not. The exam is in a few days. I'm going, end of discussion."
    new "Absolutamente no. El examen es en unos dias. Me voy, fin de la discusion."

